@ First calls render_card_oam_stats_panel to refresh card attribute panel OAM display.
@ Reads gPrng+0x206 bits[13:6] as current SIO state field: if 1 calls tick_sio_link_state; on failure returns 0, on success clears SIO bit-field and returns 0.
